  "evidence_not_before": "2026-11-01T22:11:57.373022+00:00",
  "source_facts": [
    "PubChem CID516899 records ClH2NaO5, water-containing InChI equal to the owner, and CAS7791-07-3 annotations from seven named source databases. This is database evidence, not direct CAS Registry inspection.",
    "ChEBI132103 is sodium perchlorate: ClO4.Na, CAS7601-89-0 and water-free InChI. It is the related parent, not exact monohydrate identity.",
    "CultureBotHT physical row403 records Sigma71852, CAS7791-07-3 and FW140.46; the full ignored source is hash-bound.",
    "OLS exact-name search found SNOMED765356005; its mirror is label-only for this assessment. Primary concept access was blocked; no actual primary concept payload or current active status was obtained."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "All body bytes and retrieval times are archived; this publication makes no new network request or freshness claim.",
    "The empty CAS query is bounded and not an exhaustive ontology-absence claim; identical committed bytes are reused with the original query receipt.",
    "SNOMED exact-form identity remains unverified. Its absence from current OntologySourceEnum is a separate native support/policy boundary, not scientific disproof and not authorization to use registry as a workaround.",
    "Current issue901 decision explicitly authorizes the bounded existing CAS/form correction with this unresolved lead retained; no claim that Section3 exact-term precedence was exhausted.",
    "Existing ELECTRON_ACCEPTOR role, confidence0.6, publication and organism/condition context remain source payload only. Changing owner bytes must withdraw its old full-owner role approval; fresh mapping review must not reapprove the role.",
    "Inspect the actual corrected owner and full native parent/CAS/B1 rows, including other and historical negative basis, before any new scientific mapping authority."
  ]
}
